  "abstract": "Covers Really Simple Licensing (RSL) 1.0, the RSL Technical Steering Committee's XML vocabulary for machine-readable AI usage, licensing, payment, reporting and legal terms, pinned to RSL-SPEC-1.0 (Recommendation, 2025-12-10) with errata through 2026-08-07. RSL 1.0 is the current line and the RSL 0.9 draft is legacy with an upgrade checklist. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions, the document vocabulary and conflict rules, discovery and association mechanisms, and the optional OLP, CAP and EMS protocols.",
